6% from $728 million in the three months ended 2025-07-31.","cites":["OKTA.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $3.1 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $232 million and net income to $296 million.","cites":["OKTA.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $979 million: operating cash flow of $987 million less capital spending of $8 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-07-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","OKTA.d.capex.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","OKTA.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","OKTA.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-05-07 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $36.8 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $15.7 million.","cites":["OKTA.pay.peoTotal.2026","OKTA.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $14.7 million in total and $9.3 million actually paid.","cites":["OKTA.pay.neoTotal.2026","OKTA.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $33.00 at the end of FY2026, and $256.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["OKTA.pay.tsr.2026","OKTA.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $4.8 billion at the end of FY2026, against $4.2 billion a year earlier. That is 165.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.rpo.2026","OKTA.rpo.2025","OKTA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.9 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $1.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["OKTA.deferred.2026","OKTA.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 6,366 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $459,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["OKTA.q.employees","OKTA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $4 million, after $11 million in FY2025.","cites":["OKTA.restructuring.2026","OKTA.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $858 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $350 million of debt as tagged (ConvertibleDebtNoncurrent + ConvertibleDebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $508 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["OKTA.cash.2026","OKTA.debtLong.2026","OKTA.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"OKTA":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":80,"read":80,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Ninan Shibu","Chief Accounting Officer"],["McKinnon Todd","Chief Executive Officer, director"],["Kelleher Eric Robert","See Remarks"],["Tighe Brett","Chief Financial Officer"],["Schwartz Larissa","See