yment and maintenance of AI Technologies, combined with an uncertain regulatory environment, may result in reputational harm, liability or other adverse consequences to our business operations.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"78887c818c6733b160099124b6ea0c41a043348da496c3060d98103ee48a3f62"},"OKTA.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Issues in the development and use of artificial intelligence (“AI”), combined with an uncertain regulatory environment, may result in reputational harm, liability, or other adverse consequences to our business operations.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"0b3adcb19001a83890e6719d054a37958009d3267d3b3e0a3d8abbdb762abe4a"},"OKTA.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk","quote":"Transactions relating to the 2026 Notes may affect the value of our Class A common stock.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"3fad6278bcf4b8d14d36466458a0999b099abe3e0608f628bcf14d5e462e9d4e"},"OKTA.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Transactions relating to our Notes may affect the value of our Class A common stock.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"10d7c077d33033339cac9fcaa7640511411a4e2be7570d7bd36f3ab7665d04cc"},"OKTA.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk","quote":"Evolving and complex scrutiny of sustainability matters may require us to incur additional costs or otherwise adversely impact our reputation or business.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"75b9bcc6fb88c122ab124a2e62b3d5e5cf41011e93cdc701933dce04e36e7f44"},"OKTA.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Evolving and complex scrutiny of sustainability matters may require us to incur additional costs or otherwise adversely impact our business.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"283852de9dffbc1e543e9d7e00dc153b85eae6b486515aa000c6d555d1bf0c14"},"OKTA.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk","quote":"The conversion features of the 2026 Notes, if triggered, may adversely affect our financial condition and results of operations.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"ffc0f98e2f9c7b88c58550950166034d7384b1cfdf7f0d9a569874ca8cca1153"},"OKTA.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The conversion features of the Notes, if triggered, may adversely affect our financial condition and results of operations.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"332f18143c0613ce382f267e9d72a081767ab5adcea7ab88948eaf5ae7b07cba"},"OKTA.q.riskrw.4":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk","quote":"We may not have the ability to raise the funds necessary for cash settlement upon conversion of the 2026 Notes or to repurchase them for cash upon a fundamental change, and our future debt may contain limitations on our ability to pay cash upon conversion of the 2026 Notes or to repurchase the 2026 Notes.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-26-000020","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"522a2588fb3cadba9ca5e7609b694a8b7a7774cee159a2f55c825d8a84ba8532"},"OKTA.q.riskrwwas.4":{"c":"OKTA","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may not have the ability to raise the funds necessary for cash settlement upon conversion of the Notes or to repurchase the Notes for cash upon a fundamental change, and our future debt may contain limitations on our ability to pay cash upon conversion of the Notes or to repurchase the Notes.","source":"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-05","proof":"1171b1517763b8e7253afcd053c36dc892017dbaac12a7bfd3ddea71447129ef"}},"sources":{"OKTA-0001660134-25-000049":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"OKTA","form":"10-K","period":"2025-01-31","date":"2025-03-05","accn":"0001660134-25-000049","title":"Okta 10-K for the fiscal year ended 2025-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1660134/000166013425000049/okta-20250131.htm","sha":"b2ee405aea00c5ee8a7c19fba466f1ac268fda5cfe997ac95fc9b916144e4005"}}}